                                                        <div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 3px;" class="signature">Vader: &quot;What is it Lietenant Sebastian?&quot;<br />Sebastian: &quot;It&#039;s the Rebel&#039;s sir, they&#039;re here&quot;<br />Vader: &quot;My God, man! Do they want tea?&quot; <br />Sebastian: &quot;No, I think they&#039;re after something more than that, sir. I don&#039;t know what it is, but they&#039;ve brought a flag.&quot;<br />Vader: &quot;Damn, that&#039;s dash cunning of them&quot;</div>
